<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0656_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Wha...? I can’t hear you.\nConnection must be trash.\rGo somewhere else and try\ncallin’ again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WASSUP?!\nOh, ayo, my bad for yellin’!\rI’m doin’ GREAT!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know there’s some stronger\nBlock Bosses around.\fDon’t lose heart! Keep goin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s see... I’m free most Wednesday\nnights. Gimme a call then, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh ayo! I just finished trainin’.\nYou wanna scrap again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight!\rI’ll be waitin’ over at\nthe Saffron Dojo!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Noooooo!\nThat’s TERRIBLE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm... You just scrappin’ me, right?\nAin’t you got other plans?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fLook forward to it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Chuck here!\nWhat’s good?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, didn’t we make plans to meet at\nthe Saffron Dojo?\fDon’t tell me you forgot?\fC’mon, man! I’m waitin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I spend mad time trainin’\nunder a poundin’ waterfall every day.\rGuess that’s why me and my wife\nbeen beefin’ a lot lately.\rI was thinkin’ of takin’ her on a trip\nto say sorry, but I can’t think of\fany good spots.\r...That’s it!\rI’ll take her to Tohjo Falls! What\nyou think? Another waterfall!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I’m only gon’ say this\nonce, but I...\rI REALLY like sweets. They the best.\rAfter trainin’ every day, the thing\nI look forward to more\fthan anythin’ is sneakin’ behind my\fwife’s back to eat somethin’ sweet.\rLuckily, I ain’t been packin’ on\ntoo many pounds...\rOh! Don’t tell my wife! PLEASE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0656_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lately my Block’s waterfall machine\nbeen glitchin’... Aaaaahh!\rBoomwhooshoowhooshoowhoosh\foowhooshoowhooshoowhoosh\foowhooshoowhooshoowhoosh...!\r...Haa haaa haaaaa. My bad.\nWhile I was on the phone with you, the\fmachine broke and I got soaked.\rI’ll call you back once things\ncalm down a bit here!</language>
	</row>
</body>
